  "description": "The Treehopper firmware-reflash capability, split out of Periphery.Treehopper (ADR-0063 DEC-007): TreehopperBootloaderEntry (the app-to-EFM8-bootloader mode switch) and the TreehopperFirmwareUpdate reflash convenience wrapper, composed over the shared bootloader-entry orchestration and the generic EFM8 USB-HID flasher. Kept separate so the board package (Periphery.Treehopper) stays free of the bootloader/firmware dependency chain - board-only consumers don't pull Periphery.Bootloader / .Efm8.Usb / .Hid.",
